a failing analysis under the default abort policy and inside a sweep
ground 0
load "resistor.osdi"
model resistor resistor
model vsource vsource
v1 (a 0) vsource dc=1
v2 (a 0) vsource dc=vv
r1 (a 0) resistor r=1k
control
  options rawfile="ascii"
  var vv=2
  analysis bad1 op
  analysis good1 op
  sweep s1 variable="vv" values=[1, 2]
    analysis bad2 op
  analysis good2 op
endc
